Cell["\<\
We'll create function representations of diagrams like this and more complex \
ones automatically later. But for now, let's try to compose these diagrams in \
the opposite order:\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"574ddd16-d53d-46f4-b564-474d095bcb06"],

