Cell["Diagram Functions", "Section",ExpressionUUID->"957df800-28d4-4bdb-b616-35e7479faed3"],

Cell["\<\
Building on simple compositions, we can create more intricate compositions by \
combining vertical and horizontal arrangements, introducing branching and \
merging. This allows modeling workflows with parallel paths that diverge and \
reconverge, such as processing a number through multiple operations before \
combining results.\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"9bea2c1e-5643-423b-ac6e-7aa48ec67166"],

Cell["\<\
To turn diagrams into functions, the symbolic label has to be annotated with \
functional code, for example:\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"fa44fa83-2777-4c55-9295-31bde22db92a"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{"add", " ", "=", " ", 
  RowBox[{"Diagram", "[", 
   RowBox[{
    RowBox[{"Annotation", "[", 
     RowBox[{"\"\<[+]\>\"", ",", " ", 
      RowBox[{"\"\<Function\>\"", " ", "->", " ", "Plus"}]}], "]"}], ",", " ", 
    RowBox[{"{", 
     RowBox[{"s", ",", " ", "t"}], "}"}], ",", " ", "result"}], 
   "]"}]}]], "Input",
 CellLabel->
  "In[21]:= ",ExpressionUUID->"95ce9567-4c7a-424e-8153-a9d074fb1c3e"],

